  <item>
    <title>突然的春运千里（指跑题</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678b50a19420ede9d1eee95a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678b50a19420ede9d1eee95a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 18 Jan 2025 07:02:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本想抱怨抢票太难，结果变成回家过年讨论会和城市变迁感悟的一期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：花生酱 / hj</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期广告招商位虚位以待，欢迎来投：腰枕、可乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期话题跳转飘忽不定，根据自己的喜好通过时点跳转吧 ⏭️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 半数主播祝大家新年快乐🎉（并没有说其她主播不祝大家新年快乐的意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 本节目一年内增长率高达 1000%</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 鼠牛虎兔龙蛇……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 我们来聊聊春运抢票吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 「我的直飞机票 ¥1800+……」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 终于抢到票，但要坐 24h 硬座 😣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a> 有携程的朋友是多么重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> 过年回家要受哪些罪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 「我骨子里还是一个福建人，我是一个贱人。」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a> 桂林人回家的生活就是 7 点起床，冲去米粉店？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1678">27:58</a> 过年期间怎么都涨价了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">28:38</a> 花生酱：「你涨价了吗？」花卷沉默不语。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2023">33:43</a> 步行都不行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> 捞化是很丰富的一种小吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2228">37:08</a> 爱搭不理的服务员像是加班加到疯掉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2431">40:31</a> SKU 过于单一的后果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> 物价很高的桂林，除了米粉便宜，咖啡竟然也很便宜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3308">55:08</a> 高中毕业摇奶茶的往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a> </span><strong><span>那么这里是不是应该有一个腰枕的广告呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">1:00:02</a> 预告一期可能不会完成的企划——24 小时春运声音记录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3741">1:02:21</a> 拜个早年！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜Playlist: ｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜商务合作｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们现已开通广告服务，欢迎各大品牌送钱。也欢迎到社媒平台关注我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>学台球很突然，录播客很即兴，欢迎收听《高情商台球桌🎱》。我们是一个中文闲聊播客，也是办公室日常的记录。时间和参与人员都不设限，分享当下的生活和随想，谐音梗、烂梗不断。在小宇宙 app 独家发布，其它各大播客平台都听不到如此高质量的日常节目哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目由「新八编辑部™️」出品</span></p>]]></description>
