  <item>
    <title>不突然地聊起好东西：你想成为里面的谁？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674ab871c3b2a2f3349215b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674ab871c3b2a2f3349215b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Nov 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>聊聊好东西</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>学台球很突然，录播客很即兴，欢迎收听《高情商台球桌🎱》。我们是一个中文闲聊播客，也是办公室日常的记录。时间和参与人员都不设限，分享当下的生活和随想，谐音梗、烂梗不断。在小宇宙 app 独家发布，其它各大播客平台都听不到如此高质量的日常节目哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：花生酱 / hj</span></p><span></span><p><span>登场嘉宾：Poppy（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66e06d5757b82bf37ead7541" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66e06d5757b82bf37ead7541"><span>《Settle不down》</span></a><span>的主播）</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时点】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 花生酱想要成为的女性角色——特特</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> Poppy为什么喜欢王铁梅：包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">08:01</a> 《好东西》是贴近当下生活的电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> 贴近北京生活的电影：《我在他乡挺好的》《装腔启示录》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> 电影情节与城市氛围的融合</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1141">19:01</a> 用轻松的方式讲尖锐的两性矛盾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> 谢谢邵导，让我们相信创作的力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a> 好东西里精彩的饭桌戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2061">34:21</a> 不管是国男还是白男，都对女人的面情有独钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2141">35:41</a> 你是否愿意生活在《好东西》电影里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">36:46</a> 我想生活在《浪漫的体质》里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a> 聊聊同样是讲述女性故事的台剧《影后》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2686">44:46</a> 《举重妖精金福珠》现实和幻想的交织</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> po:《我可能不会爱你》里的程又青</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3042">50:42</a> 花生酱 《败犬女王》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3208">53:28</a> 花卷：我想要成为一个更敢爱的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3423">57:03</a> 想要成为生活在新的游戏规则里的小孩儿，首先成为王铁梅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3538">58:58</a> 《好东西》里的人物来播客会聊什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3712">61:52</a> 想看《爱情神话》的鞋匠和《好东西》的保安对谈 聊上海的饮食男女</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜Playlist: ｜</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>开头曲：钟楚曦 - 滥俗的歌</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>结尾曲：Iris DeMent - Leaning On the Everlasting Arms</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜商务合作｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>我们现已开通广告服务，欢迎各大品牌送钱。也欢迎到社媒平台关注我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目由「新八编辑部™️」出品</span></p>]]></description>
