  <item>
    <title>突然的 FUJI ROCK 冷饭热炒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670e65310d2f24f2895322e1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670e65310d2f24f2895322e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Oct 2024 12:50:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>🎸 FUJI ROCK 🪨</span></h2><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目录制于8月6日，台球桌第一次走进了小宇宙的录音室。这是高音质的一期，更是高质量的一期！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>每年其实都想去 FUJI ROCK，但是因为没有人一起，就没有成行的</span><strong><span>花生酱</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span>对 FUJI ROCK 没那么了解，但非常感兴趣在那里的体验的</span><strong><span>hj</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>登场嘉宾：刚刚从 FUJI ROCK 回来，皮肤还没有恢复的 </span><strong><span>Link</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>—</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时点】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 什么是 FUJI ROCK</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> 今年的 FUJI ROCK 的阵容亮点（完全主观版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="894">14:54</a> 今年 FUJI ROCK 超过预期的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 在 FUJI ROCK 获得很有可能（99.9%）是年度最快乐的一个小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> Kraftwerk 与 Yīn Yīn 致敬坂本龙一的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1339">22:19</a> SUMMER SONIC 和 FUJI ROCK 体验的不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1725">28:45</a> 值得单独安排一次旅行的嘻哈歌手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">32:37</a> 绿洲主唱的压轴现场——预期之内的平庸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> 在前夜祭给人巨大惊喜的陌生日本 DJ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2242">37:22</a> 今年 FUJI ROCK 低于预期的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> 要花钱买票的露营体验——FUJI ROCK 的核心之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2805">46:45</a> 厕所测评</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3052">50:52</a> 卫生与可持续——另一个核心之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3297">54:57</a> 那些年没有错过的大雨——又双叒一个核心之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3533">58:53</a> 防雨思路の演变 &amp; 全球户外品牌大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3916">65:16</a> FUJI ROCK 的周边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4628">77:08</a> 希望明年的 FUJI 能……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4778">79:38</a> 在 FUJI 会遇到什么国内的名人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5069">84:29</a> 越过山丘，发现厕所在等候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5271">87:51</a> 明年 FUJI 有谁我会必去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5565">92:45</a> 今年 FUJI 有专门供录播客的舞台，期待明年我们也能……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目中提到的音乐人或音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> Kraftwerk</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> Peggy Gou</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> girl in red</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> toe</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a> The Jesus and Mary Chain</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> Ride</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> Denki Groove（电气魔轨）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> NewJeans</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> Blur</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a> Hiromi（上原广美）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> Yīn Yīn</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 张惠妹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 落日飞车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2260">37:40</a> 草东没有派对</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a> Peggy Gou（again）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4668">77:48</a> sza</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4668">77:48</a> the killers</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4724">78:44</a> Vince Staples</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5298">88:18</a> Giorgio Moroder</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5356">89:16</a> Radiohead</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5356">89:16</a> New Order</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>节目中提到的户外品牌：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>The North Face</span></p><span></span><p><span>Patagonia</span></p><span></span><p><span>montbell</span></p><span></span><p><span>KEEN</span></p><span></span><p><span>挪客</span></p><span></span><p><span>牧高笛</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>学台球很突然，录播客很即兴，欢迎收听《高情商台球桌🎱》。我们是一个中文闲聊播客，也是办公室日常的记录。时间和参与人员都不设限，分享当下的生活和随想，谐音梗、烂梗不断。在小宇宙 app 独家发布，其它各大播客平台都听不到如此高质量的日常节目哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>｜商务合作｜</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们现已开通广告服务，欢迎各大品牌送钱。也欢迎到社媒平台关注我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本节目由「新八编辑部™️」出品</span></p>]]></description>
